[options]
[A.]
<$PlaySound,thunderCannonGrowl.wav>

                  <h2>Evacuation of Rain City<a href="#mission14">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
<br>
    ~[Ipriest.56]           ~[IgrowingRainBlocker.9]~[Ianim.41]    ~[IthunderCannon.35]     <br>
         ~[Ipriest.55]     ~[Ipriest.47]                                                                ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>

After you allied with the ambassador of Rain City the<br>
warriors of Hades chased after you. Now they have<br>
your allies trapped.
 <p>
You must not only rescue them so you can evacuate<br>
them to a safer place, but you must kill the<br>
enemies as well.
<p>
             <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                       <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                         <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Your Knowledge</a>             <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Evacuate!</a>              <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Leave mission</a>
<$Tell,sound1>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,PriestMove3.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

