[@1]
<?!{sw_difficulty1}>
The {sw_god5} speaks to you:<br>
<i>"Ahh... the traitorous coward! Prepare to die a very unpleasant death!"
<p>
"But before that happens, I give you a choice<br>
Pick either the choice of Chaos, or the Choice of Order"</i>
<p>
~IWhat is he babbling about?~., you think to yourself. ~II wonder what he means?~.<br>
But you have no time to ponder this, you must make the choice offered to you:
$Button=CHAOS,Tell,Chaos
$Button=ORDER,Tell,Order

</?>

<?{sw_difficulty1}>
Before your allies were captured, they planted traps around their Temples. Their traps should
 take care of the first wave of attackers on their island. But they have no other defenses, and
 no factories built. So they are of no help to you.
$Button=Fight ON!,DoNothing,0
</?>





