</?></?>


[Chaos]
<i>"CHAOS, it is!"</i>, laughs the evil {sw_hades}!
<p>
<$Config,sw_choiceflag=1>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[Order]
<i>"ORDER, it shall be"</i>, laughs the demoniacal {sw_hades}!
<p>
<$Config,sw_choiceflag=0>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
I have captured your miserable Ambassador. I'll wait a bit before my warrios sacrifice him to me.
$Button=OH NO!,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestDead]
It is a sad day for the Ambassador is dead!
<p>
But you must fight on, for the sake of the Ambassador and his valiant efforts!
<p>
~IYou will pay, {sw_hades}~.,you scream out onto the Battle field. ~IIn the end, we
shall prevail!
$Button=A moment of silence,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
I have captured your little toy soldier. I'll wait a bit before my warrios sacrifice him to me.
$Button=Horror of horrors!,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>A mighty Warrior of Rain has just gave his life in the aid of Peace. May you be allowed to avenge his death.</h2>
$Button=On with it!,DoNothing,0


[ai5PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead5=1>
The <i>Cloud Floater</i> is now yours to command!
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~yCloud Floater~[IrainBalloon.16],GetTechnology,146


[ai6PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead6=1>
Hanging around the Rain Ambassador, you learn some tricks.
You learn the power of the <i>Rain Cannon</i>
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~yRain Cannon~[IrainCannon.3],GetTechnology,129


[ai7PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead7=1>
You need a source of energy for your new found Tech. The
Rain Fury grants you this:
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~[IrainBattery.*]~yRain Battery,GetTechnology,76


[ai8PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead8=1>
With the power of rain, you learn the power of Regeneration:
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~[IrainBlocker.*]~yIce Tower,GetTechnology,147

[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>
Let my Ambassador go, and I will spare you your soul!
$Button=No Way HADES!,DoNothing,0

[ai4PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead4=1>
It is a great day for the Ambassador of HADES is dead!
<P>
~IYou will pay soon enough,
<br>
 {sw_hades}~.,you scream out onto the Battle field. ~IIn the end, we
shall prevail!
$Button=Continue,Tell,getmanowar

[getmanowar]
With the power of rain, you learn the power of Annialation
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Menu=~[IrainAviary.12]~yMan-O-War,GetTechnology,143






[checkwin]
<?{sw_enDead8}><?{sw_enDead7}><?{sw_enDead6}>
<?{sw_enDead5}><?{sw_enDead4}>
                              <h2>VICTORY!</h2>
                                     ~[Imog.15]<br>
         ~[IrainAviary.12]~[IrainVortex.0] ~[IrainAviary.12]<br>
                          ~[Ipriest.102]      ~[Ipriest.115]          ~[Ipriest.120]
<p>
            You've killed all of Hades Warriors.<br>
               May the Furies grant you speed.<br>
                        For you will need it!
<$Config,sw_m14=0>
<$Config,sw_m20=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
$Button=To: Choice of the Furies - Rain,MissionBegin,sw_m20
</?></?></?></?></?>

[Failed]
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
Now you will meet Hades for this traitorous deed!
<$Config,sw_m14=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=NO! Not HADES ALTAR!,MissionBegin,sw_m24
</?>
