Quickly! Try this mission again, before Hades brings you to his realm!
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=8000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=6>
<$Config,sw_mvar4=8>

